{
 "panic_open_1": {
  "src": "/show/wide/panic_open_1.mp4",
  "duration": 21.72,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 21.2
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "Alright. You know what time it is.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.52
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "Oh, it's time. It's Panic Mode.",
    "start": 1.52,
    "end": 4.16
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "Rules, for anybody new. I make the case this team's in trouble, Tony makes the case it isn't\u2014",
    "start": 4.16,
    "end": 8.96
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "\u2014or the other way around, depending how I feel.",
    "start": 8.96,
    "end": 11.84
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "And at the end, we both put a number on it. One, totally fine. Ten, hit the button.",
    "start": 11.84,
    "end": 16.72
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "And for the record, I've never gone below a six in my life.",
    "start": 16.72,
    "end": 21.2
   }
  ]
 },
 "panic_open_2": {
  "src": "/show/wide/panic_open_2.mp4",
  "duration": 19.56,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 19.2
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "Marcus. I've got my hand over the button.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.24
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "Of course you do. Welcome to Panic Mode, everybody.",
    "start": 2.24,
    "end": 5.76
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "Simple game. Is it time to panic on this team, or is everybody overreacting?",
    "start": 5.76,
    "end": 10.72
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "We argue it out, then we each give it a number. One to ten. Ten means blow the whole thing up.",
    "start": 10.72,
    "end": 15.76
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "One means relax, go make a sandwich, you're fine.",
    "start": 15.76,
    "end": 19.2
   }
  ]
 },
 "panic_verdict_1": {
  "src": "/show/wide/panic_verdict_1.mp4",
  "duration": 5.24,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.88
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "Alright. Panic meter. One to ten, where are you?",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.88
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "Oh, I've had my number ready for ten minutes.",
    "start": 2.88,
    "end": 4.88
   }
  ]
 },
 "panic_verdict_2": {
  "src": "/show/wide/panic_verdict_2.mp4",
  "duration": 7.32,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 6.96
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "Okay, Marcus. Number on the board. How scared are we?",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.84
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "Let me think about this for a second.",
    "start": 3.84,
    "end": 6.96
   }
  ]
 },
 "buysell_open_1": {
  "src": "/show/wide/buysell_open_1.mp4",
  "duration": 20.04,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 19.68
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "Time for Buy or Sell.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.72
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "My favorite game. I've been buying since breakfast.",
    "start": 2.72,
    "end": 5.84
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "Here's how it works. I put something on the board. A player, a number, a take that's going around\u2014",
    "start": 5.84,
    "end": 11.36
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "\u2014and we tell you if we're buying it, or selling it.",
    "start": 11.36,
    "end": 14.48
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "And there's no hold. You have to pick a side.",
    "start": 14.48,
    "end": 17.36
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "Hold is for cowards, Marcus.",
    "start": 17.36,
    "end": 19.68
   }
  ]
 },
 "buysell_open_2": {
  "src": "/show/wide/buysell_open_2.mp4",
  "duration": 12.52,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 12.16
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "We're playing Buy or Sell today.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.92
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "Three things on the board. For each one, buy or sell. No hedging.",
    "start": 1.92,
    "end": 6.24
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "He says no hedging like he doesn't hedge every single week.",
    "start": 6.24,
    "end": 9.84
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "I commit. Eventually.",
    "start": 9.84,
    "end": 12.16
   }
  ]
 },
 "contender_open_1": {
  "src": "/show/wide/contender_open_1.mp4",
  "duration": 18.6,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 18.24
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "It's Contender or Pretender, baby.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.48
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "One question. When it's January and the weather turns, is this team still standing?",
    "start": 2.48,
    "end": 7.92
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "We look at what's real, and what's smoke\u2014",
    "start": 7.92,
    "end": 10.8
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "\u2014and at the end, we each stamp it. Contender, or pretender.",
    "start": 10.8,
    "end": 14.88
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "Loser buys lunch.",
    "start": 14.88,
    "end": 16.56
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "You still owe me two lunches.",
    "start": 16.56,
    "end": 18.24
   }
  ]
 },
 "contender_open_2": {
  "src": "/show/wide/contender_open_2.mp4",
  "duration": 15.16,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 14.8
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "Contender or Pretender. Here's the game. The record says one thing. We figure out if it's lying.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 5.36
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "Records lie all the time, Marcus. Mine says I'm undefeated at karaoke.",
    "start": 5.36,
    "end": 10.0
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "That's because nobody's ever let you finish a song.",
    "start": 10.0,
    "end": 12.56
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "Fair. That's fair.",
    "start": 12.56,
    "end": 14.8
   }
  ]
 },
 "contender_verdict_1": {
  "src": "/show/wide/contender_verdict_1.mp4",
  "duration": 5.96,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.2
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "Okay. Stamp it. Contender, or pretender?",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.88
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "You first. I don't want you copying off me.",
    "start": 2.88,
    "end": 5.2
   }
  ]
 },
 "signoff_1": {
  "src": "/show/wide/signoff_1.mp4",
  "duration": 5.56,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.2
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "That's our show.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.04
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "And somebody tell that front office, we're watching.",
    "start": 1.04,
    "end": 3.6
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "We'll see you next time.",
    "start": 3.6,
    "end": 5.2
   }
  ]
 },
 "signoff_2": {
  "src": "/show/wide/signoff_2.mp4",
  "duration": 4.6,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.24
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "Alright, that's it. I'm done yelling.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.76
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "For today.",
    "start": 1.76,
    "end": 2.4
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "For today. We'll see you next week.",
    "start": 2.4,
    "end": 4.24
   }
  ]
 },
 "banter_1": {
  "src": "/show/wide/banter_1.mp4",
  "duration": 6.44,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.2
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "I'm writing that down, by the way.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.12
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "You've written down every take you've ever had.",
    "start": 1.12,
    "end": 3.44
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "And some of them were right!",
    "start": 3.44,
    "end": 5.2
   }
  ]
 },
 "banter_2": {
  "src": "/show/wide/banter_2.mp4",
  "duration": 6.68,
  "speech": {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 6.32
  },
  "lines": [
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "See, this is where you lose me.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.76
   },
   {
    "host": "tony",
    "text": "I lose you every week, Marcus. You keep coming back.",
    "start": 1.76,
    "end": 4.4
   },
   {
    "host": "marcus",
    "text": "It's my job.",
    "start": 4.4,
